#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:13
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:5
#: b3acf7b806dc42b4aabb2ebaada9801e
msgid "When Problems Arise"
msgstr "出现问题时"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:7
#: 3794d7690e7043198f26f283c43e626e
msgid ""
"ArduPilot, is extremely capable and flexible. But with high performance and "
"flexibility comes a lot of configurations, parameters, and complexity."
msgstr "ArduPilot 功能极为强大且灵活，但高性能和灵活性也带来了大量配置、参数和复杂性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:9
#: cd8d6e5e835247fa847824fb8541d78b
msgid ""
"This WIKI documentation attempts to reduce the effort of configuring and "
"operating your ArduPilot based vehicle by providing as much accurate "
"information on configuration, parameters, and operating modes as possible, "
"and is continuously being updated as new releases occur or areas needing "
"further explanation arise. Your assistance in that effort is welcomed and "
"solicited. See :ref:`common_wiki_editing_guide`"
msgstr ""
"本 WIKI 文档通过提供尽可能准确的配置、参数和操作模式信息，努力降低配置和操作 ArduPilot "
"飞行器的难度，并随着新版本发布或需要进一步说明的内容出现而持续更新。欢迎并期待您的参与贡献。参见 "
":ref:`common_wiki_editing_guide`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:11
#: a351149503f64427a41436985de73eb2
msgid ""
"Enabling and using the logging capability of ArduPilot is usually a key "
"requirement when seeking assistance from other in diagnosing issues that you"
" cannot resolve yourself by following the suggestions below."
msgstr "在寻求他人帮助诊断无法自行解决的问题时，启用并使用 ArduPilot 的日志功能通常是关键前提。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:20
#: f6fd0e59802e4a6b85d5cc23ac3d7e18
msgid "What to do if you have an issue"
msgstr "遇到问题时该怎么做"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:22
#: 7cf5981da34e475ea84f125a2fdbb9f8
msgid ""
"Make sure you have followed the vehicle's \"First Time Setup\" and \"First "
"Flight/Drive\" Sections and carefully read the provided documentation. If "
"dealing with advanced configuration or hardware options, thoroughly read the"
" appropriate documentation."
msgstr "确保您已按照飞行器的「首次设置」和「首次飞行/驾驶」章节操作，并仔细阅读了相关文档。如涉及高级配置或硬件选项，请彻底阅读相关文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:24
#: 3ddec4a03c4a430c83d2ee49db85f4d9
msgid ""
"If this does not help you resolve the issue, then seek help on the `Discuss "
"Forum <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ section appropriate to your "
"vehicle or ground station. Do not enter issues on the GitHub software "
"repositories unless it has been confirmed as an actual issue in the code or "
"documentation. Support will be given in the appropriate Discuss Forum."
msgstr ""
"如果仍无法解决问题，请在 `论坛 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ "
"中适合您飞行器或地面站的版块寻求帮助。除非已确认为代码或文档中的实际问题，否则不要在 GitHub 软件仓库提交 "
"Issue。支持将在适当的论坛版块提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:26
#: 5a4754df913c496b88ab0dce787786b1
msgid ""
"Having a :Ref:`dataflash log <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs>` will "
"help you, or someone helping you, to diagnose the issue."
msgstr ""
"拥有 :Ref:`DataFlash 日志 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs>` "
"将有助于您或协助您的人诊断问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:28
#: 7f6b2fd4c7714a6fa0277ad308fe43d9
msgid ""
"WatchDog resets (\"WDG:\") should be reported `on this page "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/15915>`_ , Internal Errors "
"(\"Internal Error:\") should be reported `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/15916>`_"
msgstr ""
"看门狗复位（「WDG:」）应 `在此页面 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/15915>`_"
" 报告，内部错误（「Internal Error:」）应 `在此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/15916>`_ 报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:32
#: a1a3cd6f2bce4b4ea8658538b9fe88bf
msgid "Vehicle Will Not Arm"
msgstr "飞行器无法解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:34
#: ecf02c03b39344f6b0280a776a6c06e5
msgid ""
"See :ref:`common-prearm-safety-checks`. Do not disable arming checks except "
"for bench setup testing. Doing so puts your vehicle at risk for a crash. "
"Always track down the reason why a pre-arm check failure is occurring and "
"correct it before operating the vehicle!"
msgstr ""
"参见 :ref:`common-prearm-safety-"
"checks`。除台架测试外不要禁用解锁检查，否则会使飞行器面临坠机风险。务必找出解锁前检查失败的原因并在操作飞行器前予以纠正！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:37
#: e2f490197a9246dfbe4a7d3efac877fb
msgid "Interference issues on Electric Vehicles"
msgstr "电动飞行器上的干扰问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:39
#: ee97ac2f048644709ca32f7253911550
msgid ""
"Routing high current carrying wiring for motors in close proximity to ESCs "
"or Servo Control wiring can result in interference with those peripherals "
"controls due to electromagnetic coupling. Below is a video of aileron servos"
" having their operation disrupted due to induced noise from adjacent motor "
"high current wiring:"
msgstr ""
"在电机高电流导线附近布置 ESC "
"或舵机控制导线可能因电磁耦合导致对外设控制的干扰。以下视频展示了副翼舵机因相邻电机高电流导线感应噪声而运行受干扰的情况："

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:45
#: 3393ae1f5e5f495bba14aa01e01f8f92
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by separating the power conducting and the signaling "
"wiring by several inches or by using a more noise tolerant servo such as "
"DroneCAN servos."
msgstr "可通过将电源导线与信号导线分开几英寸，或使用更强抗干扰能力的舵机（如 DroneCAN 舵机）来解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:47
#: 6d3159b006404adfae5f76be362c6a2d
msgid "See also :ref:`common-esc-issues` for similar issues with ESCs."
msgstr "另见 :ref:`common-esc-issues`，了解 ESC 的类似问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:54
#: 293163f50b474022aca4d7f0ed0f3c62
msgid "Copter Common Problems"
msgstr "多旋翼常见问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:56
#: 5b01ffbba27545169cee4984ed216867
msgid ""
"new copter flips immediately upon take-off.  This is usually caused by the "
"motor order being incorrect or spinning in the wrong direction or using an "
"incorrect propeller (clockwise vs counter-clockwise). Check the rc "
"connections for your autopilot."
msgstr "新飞行器起飞后立即翻转。通常由电机顺序不正确、旋转方向错误或使用了错误的螺旋桨（顺时针与逆时针）引起。检查飞控的 RC 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:60
#: f5b66714934543eb87081f19e045ff20
msgid ""
"copter wobbles on roll or pitch axis.  This usually means the Rate P values "
"are incorrect.  See :ref:`common-tuning` section for some hints as to how to"
" adjust these gains."
msgstr ""
"飞行器在横滚或俯仰轴上晃动。通常意味着 Rate P 值不正确。参见 :ref:`common-tuning` 章节了解如何调整这些增益的提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:63
#: a728299d6c074d9da13ab0a4475754c3
msgid ""
"copter wobbles when descending quickly.  This is caused by the copter "
"falling through its own prop wash and is nearly impossible to  tune out "
"although raising the Rate Roll/Pitch P values may help."
msgstr "飞行器快速下降时晃动。这是飞行器穿越自身桨流引起的，几乎无法通过调参消除，但提高 Rate Roll/Pitch P 值可能有所帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:66
#: 9b879464f1704a65aaa6bd809ec8016b
msgid ""
"copter yaws right or left 15degrees on take-off.  Some motors may not be "
"straight or the :ref:`ESCs have not been calibrated <esc-calibration>`."
msgstr "起飞时飞行器向左或向右偏航约 15 度。部分电机可能不垂直，或 :ref:`ESC 未校准 <esc-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:68
#: 01ca37a9a7c5414cb17e1172466364ce
msgid ""
"copter always tends to fly in one direction even in a windless environment."
"  Try :ref:`SaveTrim or AutoTrim <autotrim>` to level the copter."
msgstr ""
"即使在无风环境中，飞行器也总是向某一方向飞。尝试使用 :ref:`SaveTrim 或 AutoTrim <autotrim>` 使飞行器水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:71
#: 98af3cb29c0f43b4b766767f719c453a
msgid ""
"copter climbs rapidly even if the pilot pulls the throttle down. This is "
"likely caused by high vibrations. See "
"https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-vibration-damping.html for methods "
"to improve vibration isolation."
msgstr ""
"即使飞手收油门，飞行器仍快速爬升。这很可能是强震动引起的。参见 https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-"
"vibration-damping.html 了解改善震动隔离的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:72
#: c57e7274a16743059f6946a9ec3cdecf
msgid ""
"occasional twitches in roll or pitch.  Normally caused by some kind of "
"interference on the receiver (for example FPV equipment placed too close to "
"the receiver) or by ESC problems that may be resolved by :ref:`calibrating "
"them <esc-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"横滚或俯仰偶发抖动。通常由接收机受到某种干扰（例如 FPV 设备离接收机太近）或 ESC 问题引起，后者可通过 :ref:`校准 ESC <esc-"
"calibration>` 解决。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:76
#: 57c3dce7589343638ef2c430f187826f
msgid ""
"sudden flips during flight.  This is nearly always caused by "
":ref:`mechanical failures <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_mechanical_failures>` of the motor or ESCs."
msgstr ""
"飞行中突然翻转。几乎总是由 :ref:`电机或 ESC 的机械故障 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_mechanical_failures>` 引起。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:83
#: 117321c54e6b4a4d95afc0de610b0304
msgid "Free RAM issues"
msgstr "可用 RAM 问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:85
#: 951c9fe4cc2441e7a68d5eac16e6ce47
msgid ""
"During initialization, it is possible for some features/subsystems to fail "
"to get enough RAM allocated. Sometimes this will be announced such as in the"
" case of insufficient memory to start a LUA script: \"Scripting requires a "
"larger minimum stack size\", or for terrain: \"Terrain: Allocation failed\","
" etc. Also, insufficient free memory can result in compass calibration "
"failing or MAVftp not initializing. See  :ref:`RAM Limitations "
"<ram_limitations>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"初始化时，某些功能/子系统可能因无法分配足够 RAM 而失败。有时会有提示，例如内存不足以启动 LUA 脚本：「Scripting requires a"
" larger minimum stack size」，或地形：「Terrain: Allocation "
"failed」等。此外，可用内存不足可能导致罗盘校准失败或 MAVftp 无法初始化。详见 :ref:`RAM 限制 "
"<ram_limitations>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:88
#: dd31bf9d880c4018b6f4a6e66601156a
msgid "H7 AutoPilot Will Not Initialize"
msgstr "H7 飞控无法初始化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:90
#: 31b0611fde2846c88c1aeeb553f50e8e
msgid ""
"AutoPilots utilizing the H7 series of processors can, on rare occasions, get"
" into a state where they will no longer complete initialization. Symptoms "
"are: never exiting the bootloader (rapidly flashing led right after power "
"application never stops) or the autopilot freezes during initialization, and"
" connection to it is impossible."
msgstr ""
"采用 H7 系列处理器的飞控偶尔可能进入无法完成初始化的状态。症状包括：永远无法退出引导程序（上电后 LED "
"快速闪烁一直不停），或飞控在初始化过程中冻结且无法连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:92
#: 755e003bee58441582d9881e3d76bd93
msgid ""
"It is believed that this may be a memory corruption problem which can be "
"caused by interrupting a flash memory write (as when changing parameters). "
"Unfortunately, due to the processor's architecture, there is no way in the "
"firmware to correct this automatically. If the autopilot  seems \"bricked\","
" try this to completely reset the autopilot to a fully un-programmed state. "
"This should allow the firmware to be installed and the corruption issue "
"resolved."
msgstr ""
"据推测这可能是内存损坏问题，可由中断闪存写入操作（例如修改参数时）引起。遗憾的是，由于处理器架构限制，固件无法自动修复。如果飞控似乎已「变砖」，请尝试以下方法将飞控完全重置为未编程状态，这应可重新安装固件并解决损坏问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:94
#: e789c99840184f4d82de90803bb40aba
msgid ""
"First, program the entire 2MB flash space with zeros by loading `this file "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/2MByte_allzero.bin>`_ "
"which contains all zero data. Use the instructions :ref:`here <common-"
"loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>` but use the above file."
msgstr ""
"首先，加载 `此文件 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/2MByte_allzero.bin>`_ "
"（包含全零数据），将整个 2MB 闪存空间写入全零。参考 :ref:`此处 <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-"
"only-boards>` 的说明，但使用上述文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:96
#: 8a469698f5664b85924544be13292a1e
msgid ""
"Next, download the ArduPilot bootloader for your AutoPilot from `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders/>`__. Then repeat the "
"above step using that bootloader file. This will place the bootloader on the"
" autopilot. Cycle the power on the autopilot. At this point it will power up"
" and remain in the bootloader until operational firmware is installed."
msgstr ""
"然后，从 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders/>`__ 下载适用于您飞控的 "
"ArduPilot 引导程序，重复上述步骤，使用该引导程序文件。这将在飞控上安装引导程序。重新上电后，飞控将启动并保持在引导程序状态，直到安装正式固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:98
#: e8b0377807b146e1b82387fc5f17e7f2
msgid ""
"Finally, use Mission Planner's SETUP/Install Firmware tab or the `Uploader "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/Tools/scripts/uploader.py>`__"
" python script, to load the desired ArduPilot firmware revision."
msgstr ""
"最后，使用 Mission Planner 的「SETUP/Install Firmware」标签页或 `Uploader "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/Tools/scripts/uploader.py>`__"
" Python 脚本，加载所需的 ArduPilot 固件版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-when-problems-arise.rst:100
#: 2681def5fbdc401a9878bcc05a8f2b94
msgid ""
"This should resolve issues caused by memory corruption and normal operation "
"will resume."
msgstr "这应能解决内存损坏引起的问题，飞控将恢复正常运行。"
